  S6 --> S7["7 Bay choice · Allocation engine<br/>fit, entitlement, cost, priority (f1, e1–e15, c1, k9)"]
  S7 --> S8["8 Guidance · Display board<br/>bay and route; ward or trauma team notified (w11–w13)"]
  S8 --> S9["9 Parking · Occupancy sensor<br/>status := occupied (w2)"]
  S9 --> S10["10 Stay and exit · Monitoring<br/>drop-off limit, charger use, blocked bays, fee (w3, w5, w8, m1–m7)"]
